[{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0158","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0158.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0180","title":"Generation Terrorists Designs Sojourn 2.0 路径遍历漏洞","description":"Sojourn 2.0 搜索引擎存在路径遍历漏洞，远程攻击者可通过在 URL 中提交包含 ..（点点）序列的特制请求，绕过目录限制读取服务器上的任意文件。该漏洞源于程序未对用户输入的文件路径进行充分过滤，攻击者无需认证即可利用，可能导致敏感信息泄露。CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0180"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-03-14T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:10.033","remediation":"建议立即将 Sojourn 搜索程序升级至厂商提供的最新修补版本。如产品已停止维护无法获取补丁，应在 Web 服务器层（如 Apache mod_rewrite）添加规则，拦截包含 ../ 或 %2e%2e/ 等目录遍历特征的请求；同时在应用程序入口处对用户输入的搜索参数进行严格过滤，移除所有路径分隔符和特殊字符，仅允许合法搜索词。作为长期方案，建议迁移至仍在安全维护中的现代搜索引擎产品。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/ntbugtraq/2000-q1/0201.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1052","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/4197","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19808","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/938c8c7c42ae0687cb1b4bbda0b614ab7a159527/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0180.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0180","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0180.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6962d12e25fbf447fb7ec00c59de25f9ba4e2a94/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0180.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/60cf806ffc57d6909f887b4f3823ae39ed0d7c51/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-xqgx-493j-vhxr/GHSA-xqgx-493j-vhxr.json","https://github.com/Freem93/grammar_nasl_v2/blob/63834ebb8cd6e97050e155291c7500ad53bb20c6/plugins/sojourn.nasl","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0180.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152200_152300.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_5.list.dict"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0158.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0176","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0176.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0199","title":"Microsoft SQL Server 7.0 Enterprise Manager 登录凭据弱加密存储漏洞","description":"Microsoft SQL Server 7.0 的企业管理器（Enterprise Manager）在注册新服务器时，若用户未勾选「始终提示输入登录名和密码」选项，会使用弱加密算法存储数据库登录 ID 和密码。本地攻击者可通过访问系统的配置文件，获取经弱加密处理的凭据数据，利用算法弱点还原出明文凭证，从而获得目标数据库服务器的未授权访问权限。该漏洞影响 Microsoft SQL Server 7.0 版本，CVSS v2 评分 7.2，属于高风险漏洞（AV:L/AC:L/Au:N/C:C/I:C/A:C）。官方建议用户始终启用登录提示选项或升级至更高版本的 SQL Server 以规避此风险。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0199"],"sources":["avd","cve"],"published":"2000-03-14","updated":"2026-06-16","remediation":"建议立即安装 Microsoft SQL Server 7.0 Service Pack 2 (SP2) 或更高版本，同时在 Enterprise Manager 中勾选「Always prompt for login name and password」选项以防止凭据本地存储。由于 SQL Server 7.0 已停止支持，强烈建议升级至 SQL Server 2019 或 2022 等仍在维护的版本，并启用 SSL/TLS 加密连接保护传输凭证。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1055","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2000-0199"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0176.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0207","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0207.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0230","title":"RedHat Linux imwheel 缓冲区溢出本地权限提升漏洞","description":"imwheel 中的 imwheel-solo 脚本存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，本地攻击者可通过设置超长 HOME 环境变量触发该漏洞，导致缓冲区溢出，从而获取 root 权限。该漏洞影响 Halloween Linux 4.0、Red Hat Linux 6.1/6.2 等版本，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。攻击者需要拥有本地系统访问权限方可利用此漏洞提权。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0230"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2000-03-13T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:16.610","remediation":"立即卸载 imwheel 软件包（`rpm -e imwheel` 或 `apt-get remove imwheel`），或升级到已修复此漏洞的版本。如必须使用，可通过 `chmod -s imwheel-solo` 移除 SUID 位以消除提权风险，并避免在 HOME 环境变量中传入超长字符串。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-03/0168.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2000-016.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1060","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19812","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/fbc52696b7594c66d398b40fcc0dc269121d7362/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0230.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0230","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0230.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6af0515548db3ee9e7e86d58b079762631fa8897/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0230.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/e6b10ee602769bd7be4675bf10e3382c1f100e32/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-m8qj-v452-38v9/GHSA-m8qj-v452-38v9.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152200_152300.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_2.list.dict","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0230.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--a5d6424c-e1c7-4a7d-af1f-33fa6b7b57e6.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0207.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0207.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0207.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0215","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0215.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0237","title":"Netscape Enterprise Server Web Publishing 目录遍历漏洞","description":"` tags.<value>Netscape Enterprise Server 在启用 Web Publishing 功能时存在目录遍历漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证，通过向目标服务器发送特制的 GET 请求至 /publisher 目录，即可利用该目录下提供的 Java applet 浏览服务器上的任意目录，导致敏感信息泄露。该漏洞影响启用了 Web Publishing 功能的 Netscape Enterprise Server 版本，CVSS 评分 6.4，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.4,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0237"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-03-11T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:17.547","remediation":"禁用 Netscape Enterprise Server 的 Web Publishing 功能（管理控制台取消勾选 Enable Web Publishing），或通过访问控制规则限制对 /publisher 目录的访问（仅允许可信 IP）。建议升级至 Netscape Enterprise Server 3.6 SP3 及以上版本以彻底修复此漏洞。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1075","http://zsh.stupidphat.com/advisory.cgi?000311-1","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0e6d432d517e5cdf9829125ecfaa3a6437985a0c/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0237.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0237","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0237.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8575b52c5f0d68ec89781aae82e849b4f469cd84/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0237.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/a96652a2a06e880f217d1d6526622d8501dbbd69/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-r6v6-fr35-cgf3/GHSA-r6v6-fr35-cgf3.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/DDI_Directory_Scanner.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0237.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--9d596320-2f8b-43e6-8e85-4570e3573a1a.json","https://github.com/InfoSecWarrior/Vulnerable-Box-Resources/blob/c784bcf63e1ec5c3a0116043d8653d00f0a21a0b/Vulnhub/OZ/oz-1-nikto-80-output.txt","https://github.com/GokulChandar17/SmartBridgeTeam-2.4/blob/b29f8b2b48be8f40c2ef51cec562a844a6cce660/Project/Nikto%20imperva"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0215.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0215.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0215.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0159","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0159.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0181","title":"Check Point Firewall-1 内部地址泄漏漏洞","description":"Check Point Firewall-1 3.0 和 4.0 版本存在内部地址信息泄漏漏洞。当防火墙处理网络连接时，未能正确过滤数据包中的私有 IP 地址信息，导致数据包中遗留了内部主机的真实 IP 地址。远程攻击者无需身份认证，可通过监听或捕获这些泄漏的数据包，获取受保护网络内部主机的真实 IP 地址，进而为后续针对内部网络的攻击提供信息支撑。该漏洞影响 Check Point Firewall-1 3.0 及 4.0 版本，CVSS 评分 5.0，属于中危漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0181"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-03-11T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:10.150","remediation":"升级 Check Point Firewall-1 至 4.1 及以上版本，并在防火墙规则中启用 anti-spoofing（反欺骗）功能，对所有内部接口配置源地址验证，阻止私有 IP 地址段的数据包泄漏到外部网络。同时建议使用 Hide NAT 对外隐藏内部真实 IP。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-03/0119.html","http://www.osvdb.org/1256","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1054","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/938c8c7c42ae0687cb1b4bbda0b614ab7a159527/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0181.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0181","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0181.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6962d12e25fbf447fb7ec00c59de25f9ba4e2a94/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0181.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/60cf806ffc57d6909f887b4f3823ae39ed0d7c51/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-5ffq-p4gq-g2p8/GHSA-5ffq-p4gq-g2p8.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152200_152300.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0181.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--d56ac691-81de-4b2b-bab2-e847e6e5c63a.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/80642f827c3cd89c2fb8893d0e3fe04ead516ea4/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0159.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0150","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0150.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0171","title":"AT Computing atsar_linux 1.4 本地文件权限提升漏洞","description":"AT Computing 公司开发的 atsar Linux 系统性能监控工具包中的 atsadc 组件存在文件权限检查不当漏洞。由于 atsadc 在写入输出文件时未正确验证文件权限，本地普通用户可通过创建符号链接或利用竞争条件等方式，诱使 atsadc 以 root 权限向任意文件写入数据，从而获取 root 权限。该漏洞影响 atsar 1.4 及之前版本，攻击者需拥有本地系统访问权限，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0171"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-03-11T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:08.920","remediation":"升级 atsar 至高于 1.4 的最新版本（若已不再维护，建议迁移至 sysstat/sar 替代方案）。临时缓解措施可移除 atsadc 的 setuid 位（`chmod u-s /usr/bin/atsadc`），并限制可登录系统的本地用户范围。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-03/0102.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1048","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19804","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9b149e946381b5dfe67f5c76cee65997e05f3a01/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0171.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0171","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0171.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/b8e6f3ed799539d1c038cf82ae94c10d35c39858/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0171.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/60cf806ffc57d6909f887b4f3823ae39ed0d7c51/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-w589-683q-9wm9/GHSA-w589-683q-9wm9.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0171.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152200_152300.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001229.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--20b39e6e-1cf9-4585-ba6a-9b3accd13967.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0150.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0197","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0197.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0223","title":"Sam Hawker wmcdplay CD播放器缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"wmcdplay 是一款运行于 WindowMaker 桌面环境的 CD 播放器程序，其 1.0 beta1-2 版本存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。本地攻击者可通过向该程序传递超长参数触发缓冲区溢出，导致内存数据被破坏，进而获取系统 root 权限。该漏洞影响 wmcdplay 1.0 beta1-2 版本，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。目前暂无官方补丁发布，建议用户避免使用存在漏洞的版本或限制本地用户对受影响程序的访问权限。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0223"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-03-10T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:15.650","remediation":"该漏洞影响 Sam Hawker wmcdplay 1.0 beta1-2 及之前版本，官方已停止维护且不再发布补丁。建议立即卸载 wmcdplay 或切换至其他受支持的 CD 播放器（如 xmms、audacious）。如确需保留，执行 `chmod -s $(which wmcdplay)` 移除 setuid 权限位以限制提权路径。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-03/0107.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1047","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19803","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/837e8232e5e0f859088f714711fc711909aefe8c/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0223.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0223","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0223.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8575b52c5f0d68ec89781aae82e849b4f469cd84/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0223.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/a96652a2a06e880f217d1d6526622d8501dbbd69/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-hv7g-93g6-w87h/GHSA-hv7g-93g6-w87h.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0223.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152200_152300.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_3.list.dict","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--2acf9df1-3dca-4547-9409-139a6e0c12c7.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0197.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0161","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0161.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0183","title":"ircII 4.4 IRC客户端DCC Chat远程缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"ircII 4.4及之前版本的IRC客户端在处理DCC Chat协议时存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。远程攻击者可以通过向目标用户发送特制的DCC Chat请求，触发缓冲区溢出，从而在受害者系统上执行任意代码。攻击者需要诱使用户接受DCC Chat连接，攻击条件相对较高，但成功利用可完全控制受影响系统。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.1,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0183"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-03-10","updated":"2000-03-10","remediation":"升级到修复此漏洞的 ircII 版本，Red Hat Linux 用户可参考 RHSA-2000-008 安全公告更新 ircII 软件包，其他发行版用户应联系厂商获取补丁。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-03/0093.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2000-008.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1046"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0161.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0152","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0152.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0173","title":"SCO UnixWare 7.1/7.1.1 EELS 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"SCO UnixWare 7.1 及 7.1.1 EELS 子系统存在拒绝服务漏洞，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过发送特制请求触发该漏洞，导致目标系统服务崩溃或资源耗尽，影响系统可用性。该漏洞影响 SCO UnixWare 7.1/7.1.1 版本，攻击复杂度低，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0173"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-03-10","updated":"2000-03-10","remediation":"建议立即应用 SCO 安全公告 SB-00.08a 中的 SSE 补丁包更新 EELS 组件。如无法获取官方补丁，应在网络边界防火墙限制对 UnixWare 7.1/7.1.1 服务器的非信任来源访问，或迁移至仍受支持的操作系统以避免暴露于已知拒绝服务攻击。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/938c8c7c42ae0687cb1b4bbda0b614ab7a159527/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0173.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0173","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a