证。成功利用后可获取打印机共享凭据并访问受保护的打印机资源。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0184"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-03-09T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:10.530","remediation":"建议将打印机配置文件权限修改为仅 root 可读写（chmod 600 /etc/printcap 及 /var/spool/lpd 下相关配置文件），或升级到 CUPS 打印系统并限制 lpadmin 组仅包含可信用户。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-03/0082.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1037","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/938c8c7c42ae0687cb1b4bbda0b614ab7a159527/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0184.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0184","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0184.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6962d12e25fbf447fb7ec00c59de25f9ba4e2a94/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0184.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/60cf806ffc57d6909f887b4f3823ae39ed0d7c51/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-x5cf-4wv5-4cg2/GHSA-x5cf-4wv5-4cg2.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0184.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152200_152300.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001225.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--16e4083f-da8a-4b13-b9b9-a2e0fdfde365.json","https://github.com/Vasileios-Mavroeidis/semantic-stix-vulnerability/blob/30f07606133364b9623f401bc306c8c9cbcf9386/vulnerability/vulnerability--16e4083f-da8a-4b13-b9b9-a2e0fdfde365.owl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0162.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0153","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0153.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0174","title":"Sun StarOffice 5.1 任意文件读取漏洞","description":"Sun StarOffice 5.1 的 StarScheduler Web 服务器组件存在路径遍历漏洞，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过向目标发送包含 `..`（点点）序列的恶意 HTTP 请求，实现任意文件读取。该漏洞可导致服务器上的敏感文件（如配置文件、密码文件等）被未授权访问，影响运行 StarOffice 5.1 的系统。攻击者只需能够访问目标 Web 服务端口即可利用，攻击门槛较低。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0174"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-03-09T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:09.300","remediation":"升级到 Sun StarOffice 5.2 或更高版本，官方已在新版中修复了路径遍历漏洞。如无法升级，在 StarOffice 配置中禁用 StarScheduler Web 服务器组件，或在防火墙层面限制对 8080 端口的访问。鉴于该产品已停止维护，建议迁移至 Apache OpenOffice 或 LibreOffice 等活跃维护的开源办公套件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-03/0063.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1040","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19797","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/938c8c7c42ae0687cb1b4bbda0b614ab7a159527/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0174.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0174","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0174.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/b8e6f3ed799539d1c038cf82ae94c10d35c39858/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0174.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/60cf806ffc57d6909f887b4f3823ae39ed0d7c51/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-28x7-82ww-2x5r/GHSA-28x7-82ww-2x5r.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0174.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152200_152300.json","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/M/mandrake_MDKSA-2004-157.nasl","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--c994d676-a809-44b9-a7c9-acf98cc03f02.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0153.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0609","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0609.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0202","title":"Microsoft SQL Server 7.0 及 MSDE 1.0 权限提升漏洞","description":"Microsoft SQL Server 7.0 及 Microsoft Data Engine (MSDE) 1.0 存在权限提升漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向目标数据库发送特制的 SELECT 语句，利用 SQL 查询解析过程中的缺陷获取系统高级权限。该漏洞无需身份认证即可触发，攻击者成功利用后可执行任意代码、篡改数据或控制受影响系统。CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0202"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-03-08T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:12.873","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS00-035 对应的 SQL Server 7.0 Service Pack 2 更新，或升级到更高版本。MSDE 1.0 用户应升级至 MSDE 2000 及以上受支持版本。由于 SQL Server 7.0 和 MSDE 1.0 已停止支持，建议迁移至当前受支持的 SQL Server 版本（如 SQL Server 2019/2022）。临时缓解措施：在防火墙层面限制对 TCP 1433 端口的访问，仅允许受信任 IP 连接。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1041","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2000/ms00-014","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/40c65e734a16e244433aafd42706edabef09072d/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0202.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0202","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0202.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/99462b1672511a2817705398570cd388f155e617/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0202.json","https://github.com/dependency-check/DependencyCheck/blob/7dcfc0737c21744b423c2198ae979003c2eb67e2/core/src/main/resources/dependencycheck-base-suppression.xml","https://github.com/marcellodesales/aibbp-reverse-engineer/blob/960f610d597aae9fec1cc5f03c68679be00c222d/reverse_engineer/acunetix/vulnerabilities/vdb/2000/0xxx/cve-2000-0202.yaml","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/mssql_version.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0202.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001222.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0609.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0163","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0163.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0185","title":"RealNetworks RealServer 内部 IP 地址泄露漏洞","description":"RealMedia RealServer 5.0及7.0版本存在内部地址泄露漏洞。该漏洞源于服务器在响应特定请求时未能正确隐藏内网IP地址，导致即使服务器配置为仅返回公网地址，远程攻击者仍可通过发送特制请求获取目标服务器的真实内部IP地址。攻击者利用此信息可进一步探测内网拓扑结构，为后续攻击提供信息支撑。该漏洞无需身份认证即可利用，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0185"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-03-08T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:10.650","remediation":"建议将 RealServer 升级至 8.0 或更高版本（已修复 IP 地址泄露问题）。如无法升级，可在防火墙或反向代理层面限制对 RealServer 管理端口（默认 7070/9090）的访问来源，仅允许受信内网 IP 访问，同时禁用 RTSP 协议中的非必要信息回显功能，作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-03/0069.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1049","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19805","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/938c8c7c42ae0687cb1b4bbda0b614ab7a159527/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0185.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0185","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0185.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6962d12e25fbf447fb7ec00c59de25f9ba4e2a94/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0185.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/60cf806ffc57d6909f887b4f3823ae39ed0d7c51/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-9w74-573r-6pxq/GHSA-9w74-573r-6pxq.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0185.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152200_152300.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_1.list.dict","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001221.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0163.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0201","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0201.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0225","title":"Pocsag POC32 安全绕过漏洞","description":"Pocsag POC32 程序存在安全绕过漏洞，远程攻击者可在未授权情况下直接访问其服务器端口，即使管理员已禁用该端口的访问选项。该漏洞源于程序未能正确限制远程用户对服务器端口的访问权限，导致原本应受限的服务暴露给外部网络，可能造成信息泄露或未授权操作。CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0225"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-03-07T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:15.920","remediation":"由于 POC32 软件已停止维护，官方不再提供安全更新，建议立即在防火墙层面限制 POC32 服务端口的访问来源，仅允许受信任 IP 连接；如业务无需此服务，直接停用并关闭对应端口以彻底消除风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.osvdb.org/259","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1032","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=003601bf854b%246893a090%240100a8c0%40FIREWALKER","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/837e8232e5e0f859088f714711fc711909aefe8c/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0225.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0225","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0225.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8575b52c5f0d68ec89781aae82e849b4f469cd84/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0225.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/a96652a2a06e880f217d1d6526622d8501dbbd69/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-m9jw-qj52-57gm/GHSA-m9jw-qj52-57gm.json","https://github.com/Freem93/grammar_nasl_v2/blob/63834ebb8cd6e97050e155291c7500ad53bb20c6/plugins/poc32.nasl","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0225.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152200_152300.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001220.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0201.toml"}]